\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Get-Ready-for-Wicomico-County-Maryland's-Tax-Lien-Sale\">Get Ready for Wicomico County Maryland&#8217;s Tax Lien Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Join Wicomico County&#8217;s tax lien sale this June for a chance to earn an 8% annual return. By simply registering and bidding, you could either earn interest or end up owning a property. Here&#8217;s all you need to know:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Wicomico-County-Overview\">Wicomico County Overview</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Wicomico County, located in southeastern Maryland on the Delmarva Peninsula, is known for its rich history and vibrant community. The county seat, Salisbury, is a hub for local government and community activities.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How It Works</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: The sale is open to everyone, but pre-registration is highly recommended to avoid delays. Forms can be filled out in advance on the Wicomico County website.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Eligibility</strong>: Property owners with delinquent taxes cannot bid.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding</strong>: Bidders cover immediate costs, with the balance due after the redemption period ends.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Winning</strong>: Winners get a Certificate of Sale. Most tax lien certificates are historically redeemed by property owners, but if not, the certificate holder can foreclose, although foreclosure costs are borne by the purchaser.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Property-Details\">Property Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The county sells properties &#8220;as is&#8221; without guaranteeing their condition or title. It&#8217;s important to do thorough research and consider seeking legal advice before bidding.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Table:-Key-Tax-Sale-Details\">Table: Key Tax Sale Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Wicomico-County-Salisbury-Maryland-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17110 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Wicomico County Salisbury Maryland Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-facts\">Facts</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>County Seat</strong>: Salisbury</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Population</strong>: 103,588 (as of the 2020 census)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Named for</strong>: The Algonquian name &#8220;Wicomico&#8221; means &#8220;a place where houses are built.&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Tips-for-Successful-Bidding\">Tips for Successful Bidding</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Understand the properties and their conditions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pre-register</strong>: Save time and avoid delays on auction day.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Consult Legal Advice</strong>: Stay well informed about the legal implications of tax lien investing.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/392/Tax-Sale-Information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Wicomico County Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/134/Finance-Budget\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Wicomico County Finance Department</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Wicomico County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/W2JwwNv2aeDKn9fw5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Wicomico Civic Center</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Earn Solid 6-20% ROI In Maryland Tax Liens!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-investing-overview/understanding-tax-lien-certificates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Learn How Does Tax Lien Investing Work</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Want to get started with Tax Liens? Click Here!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/hK5QVUgFulI?si=6CNoypFlOw3NjXWz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Start investing in Tax Liens in Maryland Tax Lien Auctions and earn a 6-20% return on investment!</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Who can participate in the tax lien sale?</strong><br>The sale is open to the public, but property owners with delinquent taxes cannot bid.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What happens if I win the bid?</strong><br>You must pay the full amount of taxes, charges, interest, and penalties due on the day of the sale. You&#8217;ll receive a Certificate of Sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Can I pay with a credit or debit card?</strong><br>You cannot use credit or debit cards within 5 days before the sale. Pay by cash or check instead.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What is the redemption period?</strong><br>The property owner can redeem the tax lien until the certificate holder forecloses on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Are there any guarantees on the properties?</strong><br>The county sells properties &#8220;as is&#8221; without guaranteeing their condition or title.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By participating in Wicomico County&#8217;s tax lien sale, you could achieve significant returns on your investment. For more detailed information, visit the Wicomico County :</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/392/Tax-Sale-Information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Sale Information page</mark></a>  </li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/134/Finance-Budget\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Finance Department</mark></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Need A Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>For any additional questions, contact the <a href=\"https://www.wicomicocounty.org/134/Finance-Budget\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Wicomico County Finance Department</mark></a>. If you need help navigating tax lien investing, we&#8217;re here to support you! <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a> for expert advice. We&#8217;re happy to assist!</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}